    {
      "post_id": 36796,
      "author_username": "gotsarrs",
      "author_user_id": 865,
      "timestamp_iso": "2018-04-09T00:13:32+00:00",
      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1523232812000,
      "timestamp_raw": "Apr 8, 2018 19:13:32 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "Today was very overcast as we had rain yesterday and more rain is forecast for the next two days so I decided I'd use the reprieve from the sun to trim last seasons remaining growth from the plants. The plants are all nice and clean now and the rhizomes ready to adsorb as much sunlight as possible. While working on the plants a few caught my eye and I thought I'd share them.<br/><br/>First up is the king of the crop. Saurus   <br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/HQ1YE5\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/901/27454009888_68c3e8b4c9_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/HQ1YE5\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/23cX7tf\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/795/39516640460_d0c8773924_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/23cX7tf\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/>S. Bud Wilkerson<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/HQ1Yh1\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/787/27454008608_93f4e58e2a_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/HQ1Yh1\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><br/>S. Goldie Its juat a spear and hasn't even opened yet, but Look at how yellow it is. <br/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/HQ1XJ7\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/808/27454006758_f7d46d4f3e_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/HQ1XJ7\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/>S. Flava Ornata Walton Co. FL This is a select clone from Mike Wang and one that I can't wait for to get larger.<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/HQ1Xdh\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/892/27454005028_9b90aebadb_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/HQ1Xdh\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/>S. Waccamaw<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/23cXea1\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/791/39516662950_04cf2fd89a_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/23cXea1\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS5ga\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/870/41326296831_64d4ff3fea_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS5ga\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/>S. Wilkerson's White Knight<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS4xg\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/810/41326294401_df3bb45b26_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS4xg\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><br/>S. Legacy<br/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS2c4\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/885/41326286501_c2beec0d41_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS2c4\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS3HF\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/791/41326291641_46396b786a_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS3HF\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><br/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS2VD\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/878/41326288971_d20d9c7a55_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS2VD\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/>S. Florida Gypsy<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/23cX8Z1\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/804/39516645550_4513f0b9b2_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/23cX8Z1\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS1mX\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/883/41326283711_d83c752b47_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25XS1mX\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><br/>S. Goliath I just love the lid on this thing.<br/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24AFz64\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/806/40430244385_0fe6421a98_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24AFz64\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24AFyzz\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/878/40430242675_3272636a08_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24AFyzz\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><br/>S. Moorei \"Pokiemon\"<br/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24SMXY9\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/809/40612555964_35a94a6377_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24SMXY9\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24SMZLY\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/815/40612562044_bff24cca94_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24SMZLY\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><br/>Mike Wang's S. Leucophylla ‘Super Pink’ Baldwin Co. AL (Best clone)<br/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24SN5RN\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/892/40612579144_bc2cf2051f_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24SN5RN\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><br/>S. Godzuki<br/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24SN1CN\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/886/40612564934_ee2c97bd43_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24SN1CN\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"></a>",
      "body_text": "Today was very overcast as we had rain yesterday and more rain is forecast for the next two days so I decided I'd use the reprieve from the sun to trim last seasons remaining growth from the plants. The plants are all nice and clean now and the rhizomes ready to adsorb as much sunlight as possible. While working on the plants a few caught my eye and I thought I'd share them.\nFirst up is the king of the crop. Saurus\nS. Bud Wilkerson\nS. Goldie Its juat a spear and hasn't even opened yet, but Look at how yellow it is.\nS. Flava Ornata Walton Co. FL This is a select clone from Mike Wang and one that I can't wait for to get larger.\nS. Waccamaw\nS. Wilkerson's White Knight\nS. Legacy\nS. Florida Gypsy\nS. Goliath I just love the lid on this thing.\nS. Moorei \"Pokiemon\"\nMike Wang's S. Leucophylla ‘Super Pink’ Baldwin Co. AL (Best clone)\nS. Godzuki",
