      "body_html": "Very nice sidorian. Mike's Cuprea 'Best Clone' is a great plant. If you're ever looking to add another great Cuprea to you collection I highly recommend F. Cuprea 'Bill Hoyer' clone. You won't be disappointed. ",
      "body_text": "Very nice sidorian. Mike's Cuprea 'Best Clone' is a great plant. If you're ever looking to add another great Cuprea to you collection I highly recommend F. Cuprea 'Bill Hoyer' clone. You won't be disappointed.",
