    {
      "post_id": 36868,
      "author_username": "rmeyer",
      "author_user_id": 249,
      "timestamp_iso": "2018-04-15T01:26:34+00:00",
      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1523755594000,
      "timestamp_raw": "Apr 14, 2018 20:26:34 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "This spring weather is ridiculous. Right now the Royals are playing the Angels and it's snowing. Next two mornings here in the KC area will be in the mid 20's. Stupid.",
      "body_text": "This spring weather is ridiculous. Right now the Royals are playing the Angels and it's snowing. Next two mornings here in the KC area will be in the mid 20's. Stupid.",
      "image_urls": [],
      "quoted_post_ids": []
    },
    {
      "post_id": 36871,
      "author_username": "alexintx",
      "author_user_id": 993,
      "timestamp_iso": "2018-04-15T14:20:43+00:00",
      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1523802043000,
      "timestamp_raw": "Apr 15, 2018 9:20:43 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "<div author=\"@rmeyer\" class=\"quote\" source=\"/post/36868/thread\" timestamp=\"1523755594\"><div class=\"quote_body\"><div class=\"quote_avatar_container\"><div class=\"avatar-wrapper avatar_size_quote avatar-249\" title=\"rmeyer\"><img alt=\"rmeyer Avatar\" src=\"//storage.proboards.com/3292456/avatar/mShaneRpKBaQVgrIPKWc.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"quote_header\"><a href=\"/post/36868/thread\"><abbr class=\"o-timestamp time\" data-timestamp=\"1523755594000\" title=\"Apr 14, 2018 20:26:34 GMT -5\">Apr 14, 2018 20:26:34 GMT -5</abbr></a> <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-249 group-0\" href=\"/user/249\" itemprop=\"url\" title=\"@rmeyer\"><span itemprop=\"name\">rmeyer</span></a></span> said:</div>This spring weather is ridiculous. Right now the Royals are playing the Angels and it's snowing. Next two mornings here in the KC area will be in the mid 20's. Stupid.<div class=\"quote_clear\"></div></div></div><br/><br/><br/>It really is. I’m at school in IA right now, and there’s been maybe a handful days of “spring” weather. Even back home, everything is happening WAY later than normal. My VFTs didn’t start shooting up flowers until this week. Unfortunately, the same crazy storm that’s making it snow here at school made it windy enough back home that many of the sarr pitchers got bent pretty badly and no longer stand on their own :/",
      "body_text": "Apr 14, 2018 20:26:34 GMT -5\nrmeyer\nsaid:\nThis spring weather is ridiculous. Right now the Royals are playing the Angels and it's snowing. Next two mornings here in the KC area will be in the mid 20's. Stupid.\nIt really is. I’m at school in IA right now, and there’s been maybe a handful days of “spring” weather. Even back home, everything is happening WAY later than normal. My VFTs didn’t start shooting up flowers until this week. Unfortunately, the same crazy storm that’s making it snow here at school made it windy enough back home that many of the sarr pitchers got bent pretty badly and no longer stand on their own :/",
      "image_urls": [
        "https://storage.proboards.com/3292456/avatar/mShaneRpKBaQVgrIPKWc.jpg"
      ],
      "quoted_post_ids": [
        36868
